rtion is insufficient. Repair actual problems in final reader-{role}.json while preserving first complete draft and written check. Final self_review lists all checked IDs, changed IDs/reasons, boundary-check results and self-check filename. Validate all N ordered unique FINAL IDs, actual question-clause phrases, selected source references, quote spans for quote-kind facts, complete copied source text and JSON. Preserve the first complete draft unchanged even if later final ordering or fact revisions are needed. Complete the per-ID self-check and final file for ALL N questions; an honest substantive unknown may remain explicitly recorded, never guessed. Record technical deviations separately; do not stop after a partial batch or return only an input-read/status message. Do not grade against unavailable keys. Final notify only your three paths when all required files cover every ID. Both readers receive this identical generic protocol except role/path; no failed IDs, answer facts, keys or earlier answers.
